## If something feels off

| Problem | Fix |
|---------|-----|
| Agent ignores my voice / rules | Say the opening line above; if that does not help, run `./shell/doctor.sh` and read the Codex environment section. |
| `STATUS.md` shows review or extraction backlog | Say `!review` in chat. The agent will go through the queues and the pending files. |
| Chat-uploaded files should enter the base | Tell the agent: "Ask me before adding attached files to the main knowledge base." |
| Generated `DATA_PLACEMENT_EXAMPLES.md` doesn't fit me | Edit `examples/<role>.yml`, then say `!populate`. |
| Watcher won't pick up files | Check `./shell/watcher.sh --status`. Make sure files are in `raw/<sub>/unsorted/`, not just `raw/`. |
| Need a smoke test of the install | Run `./shell/doctor.sh` (or `python3 scripts/kb_doctor.py`). |
| Imported a bundle and something is "waiting" | Say `!merge` in chat — pages changed on both machines are queued in `review/needs-merge/`. |
| Want to browse the knowledge base visually | Say `!view`; use `!view status` for the URL or `!view stop` to stop it. |

